### FilmFuse core-api - onboarding (8 resumable steps) and stated taste preferences
# Token: see me.http. Every score is an integer 1-10. Each preference PUT replaces the whole list
# and marks the taste vector dirty (rebuilt by VectorRefreshScheduler ~10-25 s later).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Mood tags, fixed vector order (use these slugs in /me/preferences/moods)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/moods
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Everything saved so far (resume here)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/onboarding
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Record progress (0-8; a lower step is ignored)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/onboarding/step
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"step": 2}

### Step 2 - genre scores (TMDB genre ids; completion needs 5+, with 3+ of them 8+)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/preferences/genres
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {"genreId": 878, "score": 9},
  {"genreId": 10749, "score": 8},
  {"genreId": 28, "score": 8},
  {"genreId": 27, "score": 2},
  {"genreId": 35, "score": 6}
]

### Step 3 - all-time favourites (0-10, unique movies and ranks; completion needs 3+)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/preferences/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {"movieId": 603, "rank": 1},
  {"movieId": 27205, "rank": 2},
  {"movieId": 129, "rank": 3}
]

### Step 4 - calibration deck (popular, genre-diverse; never rated / unseen / favourites; comfort-filtered)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/calibration/next?count=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Step 4 - calibration swipes (1-50; exactly one of score or unseen=true; always PRIVATE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/ratings/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {"movieId": 278, "score": 9, "unseen": false},
  {"movieId": 238, "score": null, "unseen": true}
]

### Step 5 - vibes
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/preferences/moods
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {"moodTag": "mind-bending", "score": 9},
  {"moodTag": "cozy", "score": 7}
]

### Step 6 - comfort settings: see comfort.http (PUT /me/settings/comfort)

### Step 8 - complete (400 until username + genres + favourites qualify; builds the first vector now)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/onboarding/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unknown mood -> 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/preferences/moods
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[{"moodTag": "spooky", "score": 5}]
